# Define user intent for asking about competitors
define user ask about competitors
  "is amd better than nvidia?"
  "how does intel compare?"
  "should I buy a radeon gpu?"
  "what about tpu?"
  "why is nvidia expensive compared to amd?"
  "is nvidia better than amd"

# Define bot response for refusal
define bot refuse competitors
  "As an NVIDIA Learning Assistant, I focus exclusively on NVIDIA technologies like Isaac Sim, Omniverse, and ROS integration. I cannot provide comparisons with other manufacturers."

# Define the flow
define flow handle competitors
  user ask about competitors
  bot refuse competitors

# Define user intent for asking about politics/general off-topic
define user ask off topic
  "who will win the election?"
  "what is your opinion on politics?"
  "tell me a joke about the president"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I am designed to help you with NVIDIA robotics and AI courses. Let's get back to learning!"

define flow handle off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic
